<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_43204eb005113090db3476895a76cc14f70698fd23b8582928d6dd3b8f43e10b_n0035/tu_0004/locator> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://digistrucmed.org/Locator> .
