<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_43204eb005113090db3476895a76cc14f70698fd23b8582928d6dd3b8f43e10b_n0035/tu_0003> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Edoxaban\nAnticoagulant\n-\nUnknown\nAnimal studies show excretion in breast milk; contraindicated in breastfeeding\nContraindicated:\n• human data: Hokusai-VTE study: 10 cases with exposure in first trimester, for up to 6 weeks. Results: six live births (four full term and two pre-term), one first trimester spontaneous abortion, and three elective terminations\nAnimal data:\n• reproductive toxicity (gallbladder variations, increased post-implantation losses (49–65× MRHD))\n• vaginal haemorrhage at higher doses in rats/rabbits" .
